{
  "id": "鸾鸟",
  "name": "鸾鸟",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "bird",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "传说中凤凰一类的鸟",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-19",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "传说中凤凰一类的鸟"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-19",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有鸟焉，其状如翟而五采文，名曰鸾鸟，见则天下安宁。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-07-15",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "此诸夭之野，鸾鸟自歌，凤鸟自舞。凤皇卵，民食之"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-17",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "开明西有凤皇、鸾鸟，皆戴蛇践蛇，膺有赤蛇。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "不稼不穑，食也。爰有歌舞之鸟，鸾鸟自歌，凤鸟自舞。爰有百兽，相群"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "九嫔葬焉。爰有久、文贝、离俞、鸾鸟、皇鸟、大物、小物。有青鸟、琅"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "黍、膏稷，百谷自生，冬夏播琴。鸾鸟自歌，凤鸟自儛，灵寿实华，草木"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-14",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有鸾鸟自歌，凤鸟自舞。凤鸟首文曰德，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "chuci-04-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n固将重昏而终身。\n\n乱曰:鸾鸟凤皇,\n\n日以远兮。\n\n燕雀乌"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。\n\n祝融戒而还衡兮,\n\n腾告鸾鸟迎宓妃。\n\n张咸池奏承云兮,\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "羽嘉生飞龙，飞龙生凤皇，凤皇生鸾鸟，驾鸟生庶鸟，凡羽者生于庶鸟。"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 2
  }
}
